<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine to issue T-bills June 10.</title>
<headline>Ukraine to issue T-bills June 10.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's central bank will auction six-month, nine-month and 12-month discount Treasury bills on June 10, a bank official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The issue volume of six-month T-bills was set at 15.0 million hryvnias while 38.0 million hryvnias' worth of nine-month paper will be on offer. The bank will sell 60.0 million hryvnias of 12-month paper. ($1 = 1.8590 hryvnias)</p>
<p>--Kiev Newsroom, +38044 244 9150</p>
